batch-vrfy-open

This repository contains the author's portable experimental reference and
baseline implementations for batched verification of lattice-style
matrix-vector relations.

Third-party implementations are not relicensed by this project. If they are
added under third_party/, their original LICENSE/COPYING and attribution files
must remain beside the copied source. The current release intentionally keeps
the verifier self-contained and does not vendor third-party cryptographic
implementations.

